{"annotations":{"destructiveHint":true,"idempotentHint":true,"openWorldHint":false,"readOnlyHint":false,"title":"Change the replies to ad leads"},"description":"Changes how a WhatsApp number answers a new chat from one of its ads: who_answers (card_then_ai, ai_first or card_then_you), delay_seconds (0, 20, 30, 45 or 60), hours (at any hour, or outside_business_hours) with opening_hours, greeting_id (a saved reply of the number), product_id, question, ads (the whole list: each ad id with its product, and optionally its own greeting and question) and follow_up (after_days 1 to 3, the saved reply and marketing template one tap sends, and nudge with its saved reply). Fields left out keep their values. Without confirmation_token the call is a preview that returns what would happen and a token for a person to approve; called again with that token, it saves. Returns the settings.","inputSchema":{"additionalProperties":false,"properties":{"ads":{"items":{"additionalProperties":false,"properties":{"ad_id":{"maxLength":64,"minLength":1,"type":"string"},"product_id":{"maxLength":64,"minLength":1,"type":"string"},"question":{"anyOf":[{"maxLength":300,"minLength":1,"type":"string"},{"type":"null"}]},"saved_reply_id":{"anyOf":[{"maxLength":64,"minLength":1,"type":"string"},{"type":"null"}]}},"required":["ad_id","product_id"],"type":"object"},"maxItems":50,"type":"array"},"confirmation_token":{"description":"For a call that needs approval: left out, the call does nothing and returns a preview and a token; given that token, with the same arguments, the call does it.","type":"string"},"delay_seconds":{"anyOf":[{"const":0,"type":"number"},{"const":20,"type":"number"},{"const":30,"type":"number"},{"const":45,"type":"number"},{"const":60,"type":"number"}]},"follow_up":{"additionalProperties":false,"properties":{"after_days":{"maximum":3,"minimum":1,"type":"integer"},"nudge":{"type":"boolean"},"nudge_saved_reply_id":{"anyOf":[{"maxLength":64,"minLength":1,"type":"string"},{"type":"null"